# Kept in Trevean's private location, never in this public repository: the
# one-shot deploy records (they name real account and resource ids) and the
# real Terraform variable and backend files. Only the README note is public.
build/infrastructure/deploy-items/*
!build/infrastructure/deploy-items/README.md
build/infrastructure/envs/*/terraform.tfvars
build/infrastructure/envs/*/*.auto.tfvars
build/infrastructure/envs/*/backend.hcl
